tyle="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">26,178</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">24,558&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">$</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">23,053&#160;</span></td><td style="border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-top:0.5pt solid #d3d3d3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><div style="padding-left:4.5pt;text-indent:-4.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">Adjustment for mark-to-market losses (gains) on DCP</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:4.55pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%;position:relative;top:-2.44pt;vertical-align:baseline">1</span></div></td><td colspan="2" style="border-top:0.5p